{"seq":1,"slug":"origin-manufacturer-hs-eligibility","title":"原产国 + 生产厂商 + HS 资格判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-determination-engine/origin-manufacturer-hs-eligibility","wordCount":1748,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"原产国-生产厂商-hs-资格判定\">原产国 + 生产厂商 + HS 资格判定</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>反倾销税与反补贴税的税率不是一个&quot;税号一个税率&quot;，而是一个<strong>三元组</strong>：<code>(原产国, 生产厂商, HS 税号)</code>。三者缺一，判定就无意义——同一税号下，中国产的征 25%、越南产的征 0%；同一原产国下，A 厂征 7.3%、B 厂征 86.5%；同一厂商下，落入措施范围的型号征税、被排除的型号不征。把这套三元组判定做对，是整个贸易救济税费引擎的<strong>入口正确性</strong>问题；做错的两种典型形态是&quot;用出口国替代原产国&quot;和&quot;用报关单上的收货人替代生产厂商&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[一票进口货物] --&gt; B{原产国判定}&#10;    B --&gt;|非优惠原产地规则| C[origin_country]&#10;    A --&gt; D{生产厂商识别}&#10;    D --&gt;|供应链溯源/供应商声明| E[producer_id]&#10;    A --&gt; F{HS 资格判定}&#10;    F --&gt;|措施 scope 覆盖| G[in_scope: true/false]&#10;    C --&gt; H{三元组查询}&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt;|命中| I[适用该厂商税率]&#10;    H --&gt;|未命中| J[无救济税 / 走 scope ruling]\">graph TD\n    A[一票进口货物] --&gt; B{原产国判定}\n    B --&gt;|非优惠原产地规则| C[origin_country]\n    A --&gt; D{生产厂商识别}\n    D --&gt;|供应链溯源/供应商声明| E[producer_id]\n    A --&gt; F{HS 资格判定}\n    F --&gt;|措施 scope 覆盖| G[in_scope: true/false]\n    C --&gt; H{三元组查询}\n    E --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt;|命中| I[适用该厂商税率]\n    H --&gt;|未命中| J[无救济税 / 走 scope ruling]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定要素</th>\n<th>常见错误做法</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原产国</td>\n<td>用发票开票国或发货国</td>\n<td>按非优惠原产地规则判定&quot;最后实质性改变&quot;</td>\n<td>转口货物被误判为低税国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产厂商</td>\n<td>用收货人或进口商</td>\n<td>用实际生产/装配主体（含境外工厂）</td>\n<td>拿不到单独税率，误用 all-others</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HS 资格</td>\n<td>只比对 6 位税号前缀</td>\n<td>与措施公告的范围描述逐条比对（含排除）</td>\n<td>被排除型号被错征</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"原产国判定-非优惠原产地规则\">原产国判定：非优惠原产地规则</h2><p>贸易救济税的&quot;原产国&quot;用的是<strong>非优惠原产地规则</strong>（non-preferential rules of origin），与 FTA 优惠原产地是两套不同的规则体系——后者为了享惠降税，前者只决定国籍。WTO《原产地规则协定》第 3 条给出了判定基准：货物的原产国是&quot;该货物完全获得的国家&quot;，或生产涉及多国时&quot;<strong>最后实质性改变</strong>发生的国家&quot;。该协定第 2 条同时要求：以税则归类变更为标准时，必须&quot;明确指出相关的子目或税目&quot;；以从价百分比为标准时，&quot;也应指明计算百分比的方法&quot;；以加工工序为标准时，&quot;应准确说明赋予原产地的加工工序&quot;。见 <a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/22-roo_e.htm\">WTO Agreement on Rules of Origin</a>。第 2 条还规定：原产地评定应在请求后&quot;<strong>不迟于 150 天</strong>&quot;作出，并&quot;<strong>有效期为三年</strong>&quot;。</p>\n<p>这条 150 天 + 3 年有效的规则对工程有直接含义：<strong>原产地预判定是有有效期的缓存</strong>，不能当作永久属性写死在商品主数据上。进料、工序或供应商变更都应触发重判。</p>\n<h3 id=\"实质性改变的三种判定标准\">实质性改变的三种判定标准</h3><h3 id=\"三种判定标准与可计算性\">三种判定标准与可计算性</h3><p>实务中&quot;最后实质性改变&quot;由三套标准之一或组合判定，工程上必须知道当前用的是哪一套，因为它们的可计算性差别极大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标准</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>可计算性</th>\n<th>典型陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税则归类改变（CTC）</td>\n<td>税目/子目级别改变</td>\n<td>高（可自动比对）</td>\n<td>只做&quot;轻微加工&quot;也可能改变税号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从价百分比</td>\n<td>增值率或非原产材料占比达阈值</td>\n<td>中（依赖成本数据）</td>\n<td>成本口径不一（出厂价 vs FOB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>具体加工工序</td>\n<td>必须在境内完成特定工序</td>\n<td>低（需工序证据）</td>\n<td>工序外包后难以取证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于：<strong>CTC 判定的结果不必然等于法律上的原产地</strong>。协定第 2 条要求以正面标准（positive standard）为基础，并禁止将原产地规则&quot;用作直接或间接追求贸易目标的工具&quot;。因此系统可以自动算出&quot;税号是否改变&quot;，但把该结果直接当成原产国结论，会在稽查时被推翻——必须有工序与增值数据作为佐证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产厂商识别-从报关单到实际生产主体\">生产厂商识别：从报关单到实际生产主体</h2><h3 id=\"三级回退与证据强度\">三级回退与证据强度</h3><p>生产厂商维度是贸易救济特有的难点：报关单上没有&quot;生产厂商&quot;这个字段。可得的信息只有出口商、收货人、发票开票方。识别生产厂商要走供应链信息链：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"producer_id 解析优先级:&#10;  1. 措施公告中已列名且有单独税率的厂商 → 直接匹配（最强证据）&#10;  2. 供应商声明 (supplier declaration) 或原产地声明中标明的生产商&#10;  3. 出口商提供的生产厂名与地址，与措施公告的厂商字典做模糊匹配&#10;  4. 无法识别 → 落到 &#39;ALL_OTHERS&#39; 或 &#39;UNRESPONDED&#39; 保留值，并标记待补证&#10;&#10;证据强度: 公告列名 &gt; 官方原产地证 &gt; 供应商声明 &gt; 发票/装箱单&#10;反模式: 用收货人(consignee)当 producer，用开票方(invoicer)当 producer\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>producer_id 解析优先级:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 措施公告中已列名且有单独税率的厂商 → 直接匹配（最强证据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 供应商声明 (supplier declaration) 或原产地声明中标明的生产商</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 出口商提供的生产厂名与地址，与措施公告的厂商字典做模糊匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. 无法识别 → 落到 'ALL_OTHERS' 或 'UNRESPONDED' 保留值，并标记待补证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>证据强度: 公告列名 > 官方原产地证 > 供应商声明 > 发票/装箱单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>反模式: 用收货人(consignee)当 producer，用开票方(invoicer)当 producer</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三级回退不能直接给出&quot;免税&quot;结论，只能给出&quot;按兜底税率暂估 + 补证任务&quot;。因为 all-others 税率通常显著高于配合企业的单独税率，让供应商尽快补证是有明确经济价值的动作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与优惠原产地的边界\">与优惠原产地的边界</h3><p>优惠原产地（FTA 项下）与非优惠原产地是<strong>两套独立判定</strong>，可能给出不同答案：一批货可能满足 FTA 的原产标准从而享惠，但按非优惠规则其原产国仍是另一国（例如仅经历不足以构成实质性改变的加工）。因此系统里 <code>preferential_origin</code> 与 <code>remedy_origin</code> 必须是两个字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hs-资格判定-范围描述而非税号\">HS 资格判定：范围描述而非税号</h2><h3 id=\"先覆盖后排除的执行顺序\">先覆盖后排除的执行顺序</h3><p>措施公告从不只说&quot;税号 XXXX 全部征税&quot;，而是给出<strong>产品范围描述</strong>（scope description），并在其中列出排除项。所以判定不是 <code>hs_code IN (...)</code>，而是一个含排除逻辑的规则集合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;AD-2024-xxxx&quot;,&#10;  &quot;instrument_type&quot;: &quot;ADD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;origin_country&quot;: &quot;XX&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;included_hs&quot;: [&quot;7326.90.86&quot;, &quot;7326.90.87&quot;],&#10;    &quot;product_description&quot;: &quot;Certain steel fasteners, whether or not ...&quot;,&#10;    &quot;exclusions&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;product_spec&quot;, &quot;criteria&quot;: &quot;diameter &lt; 6mm and tensile strength &lt; 800MPa&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;end_use&quot;, &quot;criteria&quot;: &quot;for aerospace OEM, with end-use certificate&quot; },&#10;      { &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;hs_exclusion&quot;, &quot;criteria&quot;: &quot;7326.90.8685&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;covered_merchandise_notes&quot;: &quot;见 scope ruling: 允许经组装后出口的部件按同案处理&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AD-2024-xxxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instrument_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ADD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"XX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"included_hs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7326.90.86\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7326.90.87\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"product_description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Certain steel fasteners, whether or not ...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exclusions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product_spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"criteria\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"diameter &#x3C; 6mm and tensile strength &#x3C; 800MPa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"end_use\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"criteria\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"for aerospace OEM, with end-use certificate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hs_exclusion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"criteria\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7326.90.8685\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"covered_merchandise_notes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"见 scope ruling: 允许经组装后出口的部件按同案处理\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>判定的执行顺序必须是&quot;<strong>先覆盖、后排除</strong>&quot;：命中 <code>included_hs</code> 并不意味着征税，还要逐条检查 exclusions。排除项可以基于产品规格、最终用途、甚至具体税号。排除的认定通常需要一份 scope ruling（范围裁定），这本身是一个独立的行政程序——见 <a href=\"anti-circumvention-transshipment-rule\">反规避：转口/改归类/微量阈值</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定引擎实现与证据留痕\">判定引擎实现与证据留痕</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function is_in_scope(entry, order):&#10;    if not hs_prefix_match(entry.hs, order.scope.included_hs):&#10;        return { in_scope: false, reason: &#39;HS_NOT_LISTED&#39; }&#10;&#10;    for ex in order.scope.exclusions:&#10;        if ex.reason == &#39;hs_exclusion&#39; and entry.hs == ex.criteria:&#10;            return { in_scope: false, reason: &#39;HS_EXCLUDED&#39; }&#10;        if ex.reason == &#39;product_spec&#39; and satisfies(entry.attributes, ex.criteria):&#10;            return { in_scope: false, reason: &#39;SPEC_EXCLUDED&#39; }&#10;        if ex.reason == &#39;end_use&#39; and entry.has_end_use_certificate(ex.criteria):&#10;            return { in_scope: false, reason: &#39;END_USE_EXCLUDED&#39; }&#10;&#10;    return { in_scope: true, reason: &#39;COVERED&#39; }&#10;&#10;function resolve_triple(entry, date):&#10;    origin   = entry.remedy_origin                 # 非优惠原产地规则判定&#10;    producer = resolve_producer(entry)             # 三级回退&#10;    scope    = is_in_scope(entry, order_for(origin, entry.hs))&#10;    if not scope.in_scope: return NO_DUTY&#10;    return pick_rate(order, origin, producer, date) # 版本化税率, 见第 1 章\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function is_in_scope(entry, order):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if not hs_prefix_match(entry.hs, order.scope.included_hs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return { in_scope: false, reason: 'HS_NOT_LISTED' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for ex in order.scope.exclusions:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ex.reason == 'hs_exclusion' and entry.hs == ex.criteria:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return { in_scope: false, reason: 'HS_EXCLUDED' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ex.reason == 'product_spec' and satisfies(entry.attributes, ex.criteria):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return { in_scope: false, reason: 'SPEC_EXCLUDED' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ex.reason == 'end_use' and entry.has_end_use_certificate(ex.criteria):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return { in_scope: false, reason: 'END_USE_EXCLUDED' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return { in_scope: true, reason: 'COVERED' }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function resolve_triple(entry, date):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    origin   = entry.remedy_origin                 # 非优惠原产地规则判定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    producer = resolve_producer(entry)             # 三级回退</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scope    = is_in_scope(entry, order_for(origin, entry.hs))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if not scope.in_scope: return NO_DUTY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return pick_rate(order, origin, producer, date) # 版本化税率, 见第 1 章</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段里的 <code>remedy_origin</code> 必须由原产地判定引擎产出，而不是复用海关申报的原产国字段——因为申报值可能是&quot;发票国&quot;，而法律上的原产国要按实质性改变重新判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资格判定的数据质量与审计链\">资格判定的数据质量与审计链</h2><p>三元组判定的每一环都需要可追溯证据，否则稽查时无法自证合规。最小证据集是：原产地判定的依据（CTC / 增值 / 工序）、生产厂商的识别依据（供应商声明或公告列名）、范围判定的依据（扣除哪条排除项、依据什么）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE remedy_eligibility_record (&#10;  entry_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  remedy_origin   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  origin_basis    TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (origin_basis IN (&#39;WHOLLY_OBTAINED&#39;,&#39;CTC&#39;,&#39;AD_VALOREM&#39;,&#39;PROCESS&#39;)),&#10;  origin_evidence TEXT,        -- 供应商声明/原产地证编号&#10;  producer_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  producer_basis  TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (producer_basis IN&#10;                    (&#39;ORDER_LISTED&#39;,&#39;SUPPLIER_DECL&#39;,&#39;EXPORTER_STATED&#39;,&#39;UNKNOWN&#39;)),&#10;  order_id        TEXT,&#10;  in_scope        BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  exclusion_basis TEXT,        -- 命中哪条排除项&#10;  decided_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  decided_by      TEXT NOT NULL  -- &#39;ENGINE:v3&#39; 或 &#39;MANUAL:reviewer-id&#39;&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> remedy_eligibility_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entry_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  remedy_origin   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_basis    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (origin_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WHOLLY_OBTAINED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CTC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AD_VALOREM'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PROCESS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  origin_evidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 供应商声明/原产地证编号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  producer_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  producer_basis  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (producer_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ORDER_LISTED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUPPLIER_DECL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'EXPORTER_STATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  in_scope        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exclusion_basis </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 命中哪条排除项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_by      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 'ENGINE:v3' 或 'MANUAL:reviewer-id'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>producer_basis=&#39;UNKNOWN&#39;</code> 的记录必须被月度扫出并派发补证任务：这类记录通常按 all-others 税率暂估，金额偏高且后续需要调整，是税务差异的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>救济税率的判定主键是 <code>(原产国, 生产厂商, HS)</code> 三元组；用出口国替原产国、用收货人替生产厂商是两类高频错误。</li>\n<li>原产国走非优惠原产地规则（完全获得 / 最后实质性改变），与 FTA 优惠原产地是<strong>两套独立判定</strong>，必须分开存字段。</li>\n<li>原产地预判定有效期三年、评定 150 天内出结果，因此它是带有效期的缓存，不是永久属性。</li>\n<li>HS 资格判定是&quot;产品范围描述 + 排除项&quot;，执行顺序必须是先覆盖后排除；边界争议走 scope ruling。</li>\n<li>生产厂商识别按证据强度三级回退，无法识别时落兜底税率并派发补证任务，绝不直接判免税。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原产国 + 生产厂商 + HS 资格判定","id":"原产国-生产厂商-hs-资格判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"原产国判定：非优惠原产地规则","id":"原产国判定-非优惠原产地规则"},{"level":3,"text":"实质性改变的三种判定标准","id":"实质性改变的三种判定标准"},{"level":3,"text":"三种判定标准与可计算性","id":"三种判定标准与可计算性"},{"level":2,"text":"生产厂商识别：从报关单到实际生产主体","id":"生产厂商识别-从报关单到实际生产主体"},{"level":3,"text":"三级回退与证据强度","id":"三级回退与证据强度"},{"level":3,"text":"与优惠原产地的边界","id":"与优惠原产地的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"HS 资格判定：范围描述而非税号","id":"hs-资格判定-范围描述而非税号"},{"level":3,"text":"先覆盖后排除的执行顺序","id":"先覆盖后排除的执行顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"判定引擎实现与证据留痕","id":"判定引擎实现与证据留痕"},{"level":2,"text":"资格判定的数据质量与审计链","id":"资格判定的数据质量与审计链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"临时税、保证金与日落复审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-duty-mechanism/provisional-duty-deposit-sunset"},"next":{"title":"反规避：转口、改归类与微量阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-determination-engine/anti-circumvention-transshipment-rule"}}